meta {
  name: admin-reviews
  seq: 15
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  What the restaurant reads back. Requires a staff bearer token from `admin-auth / login`.

  Sequenced after `guest-reviews` so there is at least one review to read.

  Open to every staff role, unlike menu editing. A complaint about a cold dish is most useful to
  whoever is on the floor right now, and gating it behind a manager login is how it gets read the
  next morning instead of while the table is still sitting there.
}
